  "content": "\n\n<p>這是一個以 Botania《玻璃花園》模組為基礎打造的整合包。我加入了一些我認為能提升生活品質的&nbsp;模組&nbsp;，且不應偏離《玻璃花園》的核心理念。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>若 Botania 有能力完成某事，那就是必須採用的方式。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>如果您對目前的內容有任何建議或回饋，我會非常感激。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>模組列表</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/73488\" rel=\"nofollow\">Waila (by ProfMobius)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/223094\" rel=\"nofollow\">Inventory Tweaks (by Kobata)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/224472\" rel=\"nofollow\">AppleCore (by squeek502)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/228815\" rel=\"nofollow\">OpenModsLib (by OpenMods)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/228816\" rel=\"nofollow\">OpenBlocks (by OpenMods)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/227083\" rel=\"nofollow\">Baubles (by azanor)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/224476\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hunger Overhaul (by progwml6)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/232502\" rel=\"nofollow\">Botania: Garden of Glass (by Vazkii)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/223792\" rel=\"nofollow\">INpureCore (by INpureProjects)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/226188\" rel=\"nofollow\">Default World Generator (by fireball1725)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/226447\" rel=\"nofollow\">Resource Loader (by lumien231)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/225566\" rel=\"nofollow\">StatusEffectHUD (by bspkrs)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/224029\" rel=\"nofollow\">MineTweaker3 (by StanH)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/222211\" rel=\"nofollow\">NotEnoughItems (by chicken_bones)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/222213\" rel=\"nofollow\">CodeChickenCore (by chicken_bones)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/223735\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aroma1997Core (by Aroma1997)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/74924\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mantle (by mDiyo)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/226406\" rel=\"nofollow\">Custom Main Menu (by lumien231)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/227065\" rel=\"nofollow\">Runic Dungeons (by MrComputerGhost)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/230114\" rel=\"nofollow\">Et Futurum (by ganymedes01)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/32274\" rel=\"nofollow\">JourneyMap (by techbrew)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/220954\" rel=\"nofollow\">ModTweaker (by jaredlll08)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/221857\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pam's HarvestCraft (by MatrexsVigil)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/223852\" rel=\"nofollow\">Storage Drawers (by jaquadro)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/225658\" rel=\"nofollow\">AromaBackup (by Aroma1997)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/77027\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hardcore Questing Mode (by lorddusk)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/79287\" rel=\"nofollow\">Waila Harvestability (by squeek502)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/225635\" rel=\"nofollow\">AgriCraft (by InfinityRaider)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/223794\" rel=\"nofollow\">Applied Energistics 2 (by AlgorithmX2)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/225643\" rel=\"nofollow\">Botania (by Vazkii)</a></li>\n</ul>",
